  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Ethical Recruitment and Migrant Worker Protection in Food and Agricultural Supply Chains (IRIS Program)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recruitment is a vital first step in the facilitation of labor migration. When labor recruiters operate ethically, their services benefit migrants and their communities, employers in need of foreign workers, and governments in both countries of origin and destination. This project seeks to promote the strategic expansion of IRIS into food and agricultural supply chains with global suppliers, consumer product manufacturers, and retailers- with specific interventions in East Africa and its related migration corridors, as well as in Central and North America.</narrative>
  </description>
